  "prefLabel": "En 1017.02 Annual Report Required Information Contained in the Pre-Application Reports",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1017.02 Annual Report Required Information Contained in the Pre-Application Reports. The annual report shall include the following data submitted as part of the pre-application reports:\n\n(a) Total number of reports requested;\n\n(b) Total number of reports in process;\n\n(c) Total number of reports issued; and\n\n(d) Average net utility processing times from receipt of request to issuance of report.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
